{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22312","headline":"新栽竹 · 白居易","name":"新栽竹","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"佐邑意不适，闭门秋草生。\n何以娱野性，种竹百余茎。\n见此溪上色，忆得山中情。\n有时公事暇，尽日绕阑行。\n勿言根未固，勿言阴未成。\n已觉庭宇内，稍稍有余清。\n最爱近窗卧，秋风枝有声。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22312.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22312","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}